 "source": "Claude Code 2.1.325 (`claude --version`), captured 2026-11-14 by pointing ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL at a loopback mock inside a network-denied namespace (`unshare -rn`), with a fresh temporary HOME and CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR, as in claude_code_2_1_325.json. Client forms were selected with the environment the binary reads for them: CLAUDE_CODE_ENTRYPOINT=sdk-ts|sdk-py|t3-code with CLAUDE_AGENT_SDK_VERSION (what the Agent SDKs set; t3-code and agent-sdk/0.3.321 are what T3 Code sets for its Claude sessions), CLAUDE_AGENT_SDK_CLIENT_APP=my-app/1.0 (the client-app User-Agent field and X-Client-App header), and CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_KIND=bg (background sessions, x-app: cli-bg). `cli` entries ran the interactive UI in a pty, the others `claude -p 'say ok'`. The 2.1.325 binary builds the User-Agent as `claude-cli/VERSION (external, ENTRYPOINT[, agent-sdk/V][, client-app/APP][, workload/NAME])` and sends `x-app: cli-bg` in background sessions, `cli` otherwise.",
