 "sanitized": "Credentials are redacted, session and device IDs replaced, Content-Length dropped, and long text, tool descriptions, schemas and the safeguards classifier context replaced. Key order, roles, block types, cache_control markers, the billing block, the first user turn's attribution reminder and other reminders (which the billing fingerprint skips; redacted reminders keep their tags) and the prompt it samples are kept verbatim.",
